                        "severity": "High",
                        "reasoning": "In the Node.js implementation of the `text.get` method, the `url` parameter (which is derived from user-controlled module names via `req.toUrl`) is passed directly to `fs.readFileSync`. If an attacker can influence the module name, they may be able to read arbitrary files on the server filesystem.",
